                        <h2>&ldquo;Overview of Drug Development and Career Guidance in the Pharmaceutical and Biotechnology Industry&rdquo;</h2>
                        <p>As part of these initiatives, a seminar entitled &ldquo;Overview of Drug Development and Career Guidance in the Pharmaceutical and Biotechnology Industry&rdquo; was organized on 16 July 2026 for students, research scholars, and faculty members. The programme featured Dr. Metukuri Mallikarjun, Associate Director, Immunology Clinical Development, Johnson &amp; Johnson, New Jersey, USA, as the resource person. The seminar provided valuable insights into drug development, the pharmaceutical and biotechnology industries, and career opportunities available to students and young researchers in the global scientific and industrial landscape.</p>
