                        <h2>&ldquo;Towards Building International Collaborations&rdquo;</h2>
                        <p>Further strengthening its focus on internationalization, the Office of International Affairs organized a motivational seminar entitled &ldquo;Towards Building International Collaborations&rdquo; on 4 August 2026, with Prof. Aparna Rayaprolu, Director, International Affairs, University of Hyderabad, as the resource person. The programme focused on the importance of international academic collaborations, faculty and student mobility, joint research, international partnerships, and opportunities for establishing meaningful institutional linkages with universities and research organizations across the world.</p>
