                        <p>Continuing this initiative, a special scientific and motivational programme entitled &ldquo;Chemistry Beyond Borders: From Yogi Vemana University to Osaka University, Japan&rdquo; was organized on 19 August 2026 in association with the Department of Chemistry. Dr. B. Ramesh Naidu, an alumnus of the Department of Chemistry and currently associated with Osaka University, Japan, delivered the lecture. The programme served as an inspiring platform for students and research scholars by demonstrating how academic excellence and research training at Yogi Vemana University can lead to international scientific opportunities and careers.</p>
