            <p class="oia-note mt-4 mb-0">
                These international fellowships, academic visits, research engagements, seminars, and motivational programmes collectively reflect the commitment of Yogi Vemana University, Kadapa, to internationalization and global academic engagement. The Office of International Affairs aims to create a vibrant international academic environment by facilitating international collaborations, promoting student and faculty mobility, encouraging joint research and academic exchange, and exposing students and research scholars to global career and higher-education opportunities.
            </p>
            <p class="oia-note mt-3 mb-0">
                The overarching objective of the Office of International Affairs is to enable the students, research scholars, and faculty members of Yogi Vemana University to acquire global exposure, develop international academic networks, and excel in their respective careers at the global level. Through sustained international collaborations and diverse academic programmes, the University is committed to building a strong global academic identity and creating new opportunities for the Yogi Vemana University community.
